# Where the app fetches library.json. Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and restart `npm start`.
# Unset: the app uses the bundled schema/library.example.json.
#
# Real data in development: build it (pipeline/out/library.json), run `npm run library`, then:
#   simulator: EXPO_PUBLIC_LIBRARY_URL=http://localhost:8787/library.json
#   phone:     the "phone:" URL that `npm run library` prints (same Wi-Fi)
# Production: the HTTPS URL that .github/workflows/pipeline.yml publishes to.
EXPO_PUBLIC_LIBRARY_URL=
